    "expected_output_artifact": "A new non-economic structural evidence artifact (regime-conditioned breakout follow-through/persistence table across 41 representatives, 3 regime buckets) that either (a) shows no material regime-conditioning signal, closing this mechanism-family branch cheaply, or (b) surfaces a frontier-relative subset with materially different regime-conditioned persistence, which would then justify a subsequent, separately-authorized economic envelope proposal.",
