      "conditioning_law": "Partition existing breakout events by regime-at-onset tercile and recompute directional follow-through/persistence statistics (structural, non-PnL) separately per regime bucket, analogous in form to the existing 15M follow-through and 30M persistence structural artifacts but now regime-stratified.",
      "prohibitions_respected": [
        "NO_C032_REUSE",
        "NO_OUTCOME_DERIVED_SELECTION",
        "NO_PNL",
        "NO_PROTECTED_FORWARD",
        "NO_ARBITRARY_TOP_N"
      ],
      "regime_state_variable": "Rolling realized-range regime computed strictly from already-captured 13W M5 canonical bars per representative: at each breakout onset bar, classify the trailing 20-bar True Range relative to that representative's own trailing 13-week TR distribution into tercile buckets (LOW/MID/HIGH volatility-regime context). This uses only in-sample-to-date, point-in-time information (no forward leakage), computed identically across all 41 representatives."
    },
    "why_non_economic": "This produces a structural/informational screen (event counts, regime-conditioned follow-through/persistence deltas) only. No transaction-local cost, no PnL, no economic envelope, no new v2 identity is opened. Transaction-local cost acquisition remains correctly deferred until an economic envelope is prospectively frozen from this screen's output."
